<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 1-MO BUBOR RATE 21.27 PCT, 3-MO 21.14 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 1-MO BUBOR RATE 21.27 PCT, 3-MO 21.14 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady for the one-month maturity at 21.27 percent and eased for the three-month maturity to 21.14 percent, down 0.07, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on its Reuters page on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
